1
00:00:00,884 --> 00:00:03,514
Well, uh, come on.
There's over 200 questions.

2
00:00:03,679 --> 00:00:05,309
(Leonard:)And look at some of these things.

3
00:00:05,472 --> 00:00:10,392
"Sheldon is to camaraderie
as the space shuttle is to blank."

4
00:00:10,561 --> 00:00:14,691
There are a number of acceptable answers.
For example, C, near-Earth transport.

5
00:00:14,857 --> 00:00:17,987
But certainly not B, avocado rancher.

6
00:00:19,820 --> 00:00:22,110
Your essay: I'd have better luck
making friends...

7
00:00:22,281 --> 00:00:25,121
...if I wait till the Cylons take over?

8
00:00:26,034 --> 00:00:27,704
(Leonard:)Please.

9
00:00:27,870 --> 00:00:29,750
(Leonard:)Hold on. I put some real work into that.

10
00:00:29,913 --> 00:00:32,203
(Penny:)Yes, well,
it's better than what Wolowitz did.

11
00:00:32,374 --> 00:00:37,044
(Sheldon:)He drew a raccoon with what appears
to be a distended scrotum.

12
00:00:39,047 --> 00:00:40,177
It's kind of cute.

13
00:00:41,383 --> 00:00:44,133
- Uh, till you get to the scrotum.
- Yeah.

14
00:00:44,303 --> 00:00:48,393
(Sheldon:)What hope do I have for establishing
new relationships, given that my friends...

15
00:00:48,557 --> 00:00:51,437
...could not take a few hours
out of their lives to help me?

16
00:00:51,602 --> 00:00:55,232
Well, Sheldon, I'm not going
to defend a big-balled raccoon.

17
00:00:55,731 --> 00:00:56,941
Oh, I don't see how you could.

18
00:00:57,107 --> 00:01:00,777
Ugh. What I'm trying to say
is that you can't approach this...

